\chapter{Production Bill of Materials (BOM)}

\section{BOM Overview}

This Production BOM defines all components required for full manufacturing
of the MPS--PCE hardware platform, including PCB-level parts, mechanical
assemblies, thermal systems, power delivery modules, and compliance-critical
elements. All components listed meet IPC, UL, CE, FCC, and RoHS requirements.

